+# ── mock-model loop integration (real AIAgent.run_conversation) ──────────────
+#
+# Pattern reused from tests/run_agent/test_81641_text_turn_incremental_persistence.py
+# (real agent, MagicMock provider client, SimpleNamespace responses) and
+# tests/run_agent/test_conversation_fallback_state.py (minimal tool defs +
+# valid_tool_names). The deadline tools execute through the REAL inline path
+# (agent/tool_executor.py → INLINE_TOOL_EXECUTORS); nothing is stubbed except
